  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 4df0014cb02a0cf4bbbc7addabd2224a, type: 3}
  m_Name: IntroShopDialogue 1ng+
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  lines:
  - speakerName: Pig
    text: Ho ho! I see you've slain all the slimes and are a bit stronger. Turns
      out you knew how to use that sword, after all!
  - speakerName: Pig
    text: Now, as you may know, this here's my lil' shop. You know the purple orbs,
      right?
  - speakerName: Pig
    text: You can use them to buy all kinds of things in this establishment.
  - speakerName: Pig
    text: 'Those same ones you use in crafting, and others that are exclusive to
      this store. '
  - speakerName: Pig
    text: "So, as a reward for not being completely useless, I'll let you grab a
      cool new powe\u2014oh...you already have that also. Suspicious, I would say...very,
      very weird. "
  - speakerName: Pig
    text: VERY weird.
